  "notes": [
    "Repairs hunter awareness: deliberately approaching a hunter interrupts your opening protection, and sustained nearby walking can escalate into a hunt. Distant players retain entry protection and safe rooms remain protected.",
    "Rebuilds the Briarwake farmer in Blender with a dark stitched hood, recessed red eyes, leather apron, fitted cuffs and a shorter two-handed chainsaw.",
    "Uses six saved Blender actions for idle, walking, running and three distinct strikes. Host-authoritative attack phases synchronize the visible windup, impact and recovery across multiplayer peers.",
    "Hunters turn toward a committed strike; the farmer's physical reach now matches the shorter weapon. Quiet hiding, walls, retreating and sidestepping remain useful escape options.",
    "Replaces estate path lamps and the lantern ward with an original Blender wrought-iron oil lantern. Grounded fixtures sit beside turns with foliage recesses, clear walking lanes and localized warm illumination.",
    "Windows 10/11 x64. Close the game, choose Check for updates, then Update & restart in the launcher. All players in your group should update."
  ],
